{
	"name": "Magical Traditionalist",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/magic/symbols/rune-sigil-green-purple.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>You have sought the deep magical traditions and have come away with your efforts rewarded. You gain the following benefits:</p><ul><li><p>Your Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma score increases by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p></li><li><p>You learn a spell of up to 2nd level that is not part of the multiclass school from any spell list. It counts as a witch spell for you and is prepared as normal.</p></li><li><p>You gain proficiency with the Arcana, Nature, and Religion skills, or an expertise die if you are already proficient.</p></li><li><p>You gain proficiency with alchemist’s supplies.</p></li></ul>",
